{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"29a66b6084e16a15216a0bebd84568928deaf784330371b4ab7b9deca912f818","ja":"みんなのマイニュース","zh":"大家的个人新闻","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1fa6e9e8b1c6822cf6e7bb8f994b68782b7912b282a3448a9b3de7855a75f321","ja":"「それでは、最近身近で起こったマイニュースを\n聞かせてください」","zh":"“那么，请和大家聊聊\n最近身边发生的新鲜事吧”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5ca3d16bf80c38b5a51c4dfa45c577463efd82f3a1216af356e5e4f0b15e1861","ja":"じゃあ、私から……。一番のニュースは、私たちの\n公演が無事、千秋楽を迎えられたことです。","zh":"那么，就由我先来……头号大新闻就是，我们的\n公演顺利迎来了千秋乐。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ad55e3f401ae3df22dbea2144755e7fef9318ce8a8ee7eebfdc349a0a4c9abf4","ja":"わわっ！　先に言われちゃった！\nえっと～……私も琴葉さんとおんなじです！","zh":"哇哇！被抢先说出来了！\n那个～……我和琴叶小姐也是一样的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a6700ced620e5f252a0bb3c5fd1a135766f6c30efe3dacd0b99f37688e54f3b6","ja":"色々大変なこともありましたけど、すごく\n勉強になったので！　この経験を次に活かしたいです！","zh":"虽然也有各种不容易的地方，但真的\n学到了很多！我想把这次的经验运用到下一次中！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ed9967ba2544af859b624f87c9ad6d6f557cb65f712ebf0a58d13c5731c9fd9e","ja":"カナ、すっごく頑張ってたもんネ！\nワタシも負けてられない、って思ったヨー！","zh":"可奈超级努力的呢！\n我也觉得不能输给她哟！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0e2eaeae41150d14928e70d56edae117fbebcd3f034d975bb0daddb2829303ec","ja":"あ、ワタシは家族と、\n公演お疲れさまパーティーをしたことかナ！","zh":"啊，我大概是和家人一起\n开了演出庆功派对吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b18d830cc9788f44c411e06f12c8d6ff76b55a82f531dcd54cd5b90adb1f5bf7","ja":"最高に楽しくって、\n気分もすっかりリフレッシュしたヨ♪","zh":"玩得超级开心，\n整个人也彻底放松下来了哟♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"111243afbe65581c7e12a82d225d7989e5177c7b9e5000b57d8ee7b739d388b4","ja":"アタシはね、真珠星のイメージに合わせたメイクを\nいっぱい考えたことかな！　今日もやってるんだよ♪","zh":"我呀，为了契合角宿一的风格，\n琢磨了好多妆容呢！今天也是化了这个妆哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"00b3805958bbf6d033d08ad3c3d8ca0f0e3c6cd941dd4880e8df4eada1bbf721","ja":"「なるほど！　言われてみれば目元に\nパールホワイトのラメが……！」","zh":"「原来如此！经你这么一说，眼角处\n确实有珠光白色的闪粉……！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f791d3a5f858a644b64440f6a5d507d879490c48046732247a7835e350f13d99","ja":"私は……プロムをイメージしたお料理を\nいっぱい作って、友達とパーティーしたことです！","zh":"我做了很多……以舞会为概念设计的料理，\n并和朋友们一起开了派对！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"47ee79c51f14cddc4e59f5f57ede154fde652664f647dddd964b441f6a84db66","ja":"プロムって、卒業とか、学年の最後にやるダンス\nパーティーなんですけど。たしかスマホに写真が……。","zh":"所谓舞会（Prom），就是毕业或者学年结束时举办的\n舞会。我记得手机里应该有照片来着……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3ace8c975128e0a3db9ce9ced240c3a2352c67acc1bcc04be8624d5d3129f78e","ja":"あった！　これです！","zh":"找到了！就是这个！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"92af38fc4bffedcb85c0d049f87239d7af26eb4ca59a45d582f686c1b10c61ad","ja":"わあ～、メッチャおいしそう！\n飾りつけも豪華で、本物のプロムみたい！","zh":"哇～，看起来超好吃！\n装饰也好豪华，简直就像真正的毕业舞会一样！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a8a79c91f50df5b1b0df10ee328a5dba4a32585e60fde867fe61c682b8218df7","ja":"こんな楽しそうなことしてるなんて、いいな～。\n次はアタシも誘ってよ！","zh":"居然在做这么好玩的事，真好啊～。\n下次也要叫上我哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d9897ab40a24af6be510026d0eeb062f9280649ab9711a2a4017b63cd4423789","ja":"もちろん♪　次は、劇場のみんなでやろうね♪\nその時も、腕によりをかけてお料理を作るよ！","zh":"当然啦♪　下次剧场的大家一起做吧♪\n到时我也会大显身手做料理的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1455.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"41ed52d5613c2f93aeb6935a7d5f8b5046e2ceaf82fe1eb6deffd1c01ebe8d8a","ja":"「申し訳ありません。名残惜しいのですが、放送終了の\nお時間です！　では、また来週をお楽しみにー！」","zh":"“非常抱歉。虽然很舍不得，但已经到了广播结束的\n时间！那么，敬请期待下周吧——！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
